    <title><![CDATA[空天科学与技术学院教师发展交流宣讲会]]></title>
    <link>https://jnzel.github.io/bupt-info/articles/138919.html</link>
    <guid>https://mymob.bupt.edu.cn/xntz_content.jsp?urltype=news.NewsContentUrl&amp;wbtreeid=2241&amp;wbnewsid=138919</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[各位老师： 当前，中美两国在人工智能领域的竞争已经趋于明朗，时间在“我”、优势在“我”，太空将是未来的“第二战”，同时，2026年“航天强国”首次被写入国家五年规划纲要。因此，空天科技正成为大国博弈的主战场，更是推动未来产业变革和科技创新的焦点方向。 雄安新区作为国家战略新区和未来之城，正加快建设创新驱动发展引领区，为空天科技创新、未来产业培育和新兴学科发展提供了重要战略承载平台。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;为抢抓空天发展新机遇，学校积极推进空天科学与技术学院建设，并于2026年7月23日在雄安新区正式揭牌，开启面向空天领域未来发展的新篇章。学院以新兴学科体系为基础...]]></description>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">各位老师：</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">当前，中美两国在人工智能领域的竞争已经趋于明朗，时间在</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">“我”、优势在“我”，太空将是未来的“第二战”，同时，2026年“航天强国”首次被写入国家五年规划纲要。因此，空天科技正成为大国博弈的主战场，更是推动未来产业变革和科技创新的焦点方向。</span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">雄安新区作为国家战略新区和未来之城，正加快建设创新驱动发展引领区，为空天科技创新、未来产业培育和新兴学科发展提供了重要战略承载平台。</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">为抢抓空天发展新机遇，学校积极推进空天科学与技术学院建设，并于</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">2026年7月23日在雄安新区正式揭牌，开启面向空天领域未来发展的新篇章。学院以新兴学科体系为基础、以新质创新平台为支撑、以新域学习空间为载体，聚焦空天领域重大需求和未来产业发展方向，覆盖空天产业关键环节，着力培养空天领域拔尖创新人才，探索教育、科技、人才一体化发展的新模式，打造高等教育改革创新示范平台。 </span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">为进一步凝聚学校优势力量，汇聚优秀人才参与学院建设，现面向全校教师举办</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">“空天科学与技术学院教师发展交流宣讲会”。诚邀各位老师参加，共同探索空天领域发展机遇，拓展新的科研方向和发展空间，共创空天科学与技术学院建设新篇章。</span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">一、宣讲内容</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:36px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">（一）空天科学与技术学院建设背景与发展定位</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:29px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp;介绍学院建设背景、战略定位、发展目标及重点布局方向。</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:36px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">（二）空天领域发展机遇与教师发展空间</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:29px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp;介绍空天领域发展趋势、雄安新区建设机遇以及参与学院建设的发展空间。</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:36px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">（三）教师参与学院建设方式与支持政策</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:29px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp;介绍教师参与学院建设的方式、科研支持、人才培养、资源保障等相关政策。</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:36px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">（四）交流研讨与意向沟通</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:29px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp;围绕教师个人发展需求、研究方向拓展及加入学院等需求开展深入交流。</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">二、参加对象</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">面向全校各学院教师，欢迎具有相关研究基础、交叉创新潜力或希望拓展空天领域研究方向的教师参加。</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">三、宣讲时间及地点</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">宣讲人：王尚广（空天科学与技术学院执行院长）</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">时间：</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">2026</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">年</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">8</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">月</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">4</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">日（星期</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">二</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">）</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">10</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">:</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">00</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">地点：</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">西土城校区</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">科研楼</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">610会议室</span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:29px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; 因时间安排无法现场参会的老师，可线上参加。</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:29px;text-indent:0"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">&nbsp; 腾讯会议号：</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">731-273-359</span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:21px"><br></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;text-indent:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp;空天领域孕育着新的科技革命和产业变革，也为学校学科交叉融合和教师发展提供了新的机遇。诚邀各位老师积极参与，共谋发展、共创未来！</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:29px"><br></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:213px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 空天科学与技术学院</span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:384px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2026</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">年</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">8</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">月</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">1</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_gb2312;font-size:21px">日</span></p>
<p><br></p>]]></content:encoded>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT+08:00</pubDate>
